1
00:00:16,534 --> 00:00:22,869
(Firefly Theater)

2
00:00:43,456 --> 00:00:47,392
♪Neon lights twist into a knot♪

3
00:00:49,024 --> 00:00:52,608
♪I rest in the ruins of defeat♪

4
00:00:53,184 --> 00:00:55,520
♪You tap your fingers lightly♪

5
00:00:55,904 --> 00:00:58,656
♪I fall into the abyss♪

6
00:00:59,488 --> 00:01:02,080
♪I've seen this game before♪

7
00:01:02,080 --> 00:01:04,768
♪Every single move was calculated♪

8
00:01:04,768 --> 00:01:07,168
♪I finally see your silhouette♪

9
00:01:07,552 --> 00:01:10,304
♪Just an empty shell♪

10
00:01:10,624 --> 00:01:13,440
♪I've broken this game before♪

11
00:01:13,440 --> 00:01:15,872
♪Every move was placed wrong♪

12
00:01:15,872 --> 00:01:18,016
♪Now it's my turn to play♪

13
00:01:18,208 --> 00:01:25,056
♪I'll show you what stunning looks like♪

14
00:01:25,728 --> 00:01:28,256
♪When I stand back up again♪

15
00:01:28,544 --> 00:01:30,400
♪The whole city goes dark♪

16
00:01:31,264 --> 00:01:33,952
♪For the part you owe me♪

17
00:01:34,112 --> 00:01:41,088
♪I'll make you pay double♪

18
00:01:42,624 --> 00:01:47,360
♪You're just my starting point♪

19
00:01:51,712 --> 00:01:52,739
=The Vanishing Beauty=

20
00:01:53,128 --> 00:01:55,848
=Episode 2=

21
00:01:59,330 --> 00:01:59,851
Ma'am,

22
00:02:00,131 --> 00:02:00,851
is Mr. Di here?

23
00:02:00,931 --> 00:02:02,011
An urgent document needs

24
00:02:02,011 --> 00:02:03,011
his signature tonight.

25
00:02:03,090 --> 00:02:03,851
But he didn't reply

26
00:02:03,851 --> 00:02:04,500
to my message.

27
00:02:07,530 --> 00:02:08,291
(Honey,)

28
00:02:08,770 --> 00:02:10,131
Right now in my heart,

29
00:02:10,330 --> 00:02:11,842
you're Jiangzhou's most handsome man.

30
00:02:12,930 --> 00:02:13,691
Check the wind.

31
00:02:14,091 --> 00:02:15,610
Adjust our altitude in advance.

32
00:02:16,050 --> 00:02:16,691
Do you like

33
00:02:16,691 --> 00:02:17,851
looking down on the city?

34
00:02:19,770 --> 00:02:21,531
But I like seeing you change yourself

35
00:02:22,131 --> 00:02:23,371
for me even more.

36
00:02:23,730 --> 00:02:24,450
Thank you, honey.

37
00:02:25,450 --> 00:02:26,291
Thank you too,

38
00:02:28,011 --> 00:02:29,770
(Wen Xiaoxiao, Jiangzhou Airspace Helicopter Club)
Safety Officer Ms. Wen.

39
00:02:31,770 --> 00:02:32,394
You're welcome.

40
00:02:56,851 --> 00:02:57,571
(By the way,)

41
00:02:57,610 --> 00:02:59,170
(you need to find out the mistress.)

42
00:02:59,251 --> 00:03:00,610
(Words can lie,)

43
00:03:00,811 --> 00:03:01,753
(but scents never do.)

44
00:03:03,811 --> 00:03:04,490
Are you okay?

45
00:03:10,811 --> 00:03:11,251
Thank you.

46
00:03:15,011 --> 00:03:15,924
You're from Jiali too?

47
00:03:16,411 --> 00:03:17,291
I'm in accounting.

48
00:03:17,371 --> 00:03:18,330
Helicopter training

49
00:03:18,371 --> 00:03:19,170
is just my side gig.

50
00:03:20,450 --> 00:03:21,802
I remember your last name is Wen.

51
00:03:21,930 --> 00:03:22,490
Wen Xiaoxiao.

52
00:03:29,291 --> 00:03:30,371
Weng Yue, please come in.

53
00:03:30,610 --> 00:03:31,011
Okay.

54
00:04:11,050 --> 00:04:12,490
It's your wife's lipstick.

55
00:04:13,930 --> 00:04:14,490
Good on me?

56
00:04:42,568 --> 00:04:44,107
(Wen Xiaoxiao
Jiangzhou Airspace Helicopter Club)

57
00:04:45,611 --> 00:04:46,491
Do you have a cold?

58
00:04:48,731 --> 00:04:49,530
Not a cold.

59
00:04:49,970 --> 00:04:51,890
My husband used an essential oil lately.

60
00:04:52,011 --> 00:04:53,095
It set off my allergies.

61
00:04:54,850 --> 00:04:56,171
What a coincidence, Ms. Wen.

62
00:04:59,051 --> 00:05:00,090
You wear the same scent.

63
00:05:01,890 --> 00:05:02,970
Since we work in beauty,

64
00:05:03,171 --> 00:05:04,491
we always test new products.

65
00:05:05,530 --> 00:05:07,011
I often share scents with colleagues.

66
00:05:10,210 --> 00:05:11,731
On our anniversary,

67
00:05:11,931 --> 00:05:13,330
watching fireworks from a chopper

68
00:05:14,051 --> 00:05:15,450
was your idea for Liren, right?

69
00:05:16,811 --> 00:05:17,290
No.

70
00:05:17,650 --> 00:05:18,691
It was Mr. Di's own idea.

71
00:05:19,371 --> 00:05:20,330
I just happened to be

72
00:05:20,330 --> 00:05:21,450
at the flight club,

73
00:05:21,931 --> 00:05:22,931
so I gave him

74
00:05:23,051 --> 00:05:24,410
a few past examples.

75
00:05:24,731 --> 00:05:27,051
You do two jobs, Ms. Wen?

76
00:05:27,371 --> 00:05:28,650
You must work late often.

77
00:05:28,850 --> 00:05:30,330
No wonder you look a bit pale.

78
00:05:31,210 --> 00:05:32,090
How about this?

79
00:05:32,491 --> 00:05:33,770
I have a lipstick with a shade

80
00:05:33,970 --> 00:05:34,970
that'd look great on you.

81
00:05:35,210 --> 00:05:36,262
I'll give it to you later.

82
00:05:37,330 --> 00:05:37,770
Thank you.

83
00:05:38,611 --> 00:05:39,770
I actually had one before,

84
00:05:40,131 --> 00:05:41,731
but I threw it away.

85
00:05:42,371 --> 00:05:43,210
Do you know why?

86
00:05:43,491 --> 00:05:44,131
Why?

87
00:05:45,011 --> 00:05:45,450
Honey,

88
00:05:47,090 --> 00:05:48,210
what are you talking about?

89
00:05:49,530 --> 00:05:50,410
Honey,

90
00:05:50,931 --> 00:05:52,571
I was just asking Ms. Wen

91
00:05:52,611 --> 00:05:54,090
if you're harsh with your staff.

92
00:05:54,210 --> 00:05:55,051
Now that you're here,

93
00:05:55,371 --> 00:05:56,691
she's too intimidated to speak.

94
00:05:57,611 --> 00:05:59,611
Don't you know whether I'm harsh or not?

95
00:06:01,171 --> 00:06:02,491
What if you're just acting

96
00:06:02,530 --> 00:06:03,251
in front of me?

97
00:06:05,090 --> 00:06:06,011
Okay, let's drop it.

98
00:06:06,131 --> 00:06:06,770
Ms. Wen,

99
00:06:07,171 --> 00:06:08,131
grab some food.

100
00:06:09,171 --> 00:06:10,731
These are salmon rolls.

101
00:06:10,970 --> 00:06:11,691
And these are

102
00:06:11,731 --> 00:06:12,890
smoked salmon tartares.

103
00:06:14,290 --> 00:06:14,770
Honey,

104
00:06:15,290 --> 00:06:16,210
I just realized

105
00:06:16,931 --> 00:06:18,530
you're serving one fish two ways.

106
00:06:21,410 --> 00:06:22,143
Mr. Dong is here.

107
00:06:22,491 --> 00:06:23,371
Let's go say hello.

108
00:06:23,811 --> 00:06:24,371
Just a second.

109
00:06:25,970 --> 00:06:26,611
Ms. Wen,

110
00:06:26,850 --> 00:06:27,811
a friend of mine

111
00:06:28,011 --> 00:06:29,090
wants to learn to fly too.

112
00:06:29,811 --> 00:06:30,731
Let's add each other.

113
00:06:42,051 --> 00:06:43,155
I have a trial lesson today.

114
00:06:44,410 --> 00:06:45,870
This lady has been waiting a while.

115
00:06:46,131 --> 00:06:47,419
She booked a one-on-one lesson.

116
00:06:59,290 --> 00:07:00,770
You have to memorize so many buttons'

117
00:07:00,890 --> 00:07:02,051
locations and functions.

118
00:07:02,210 --> 00:07:03,611
Ms. Wen, your management skills

119
00:07:03,691 --> 00:07:04,691
must be top-notch.

120
00:07:05,090 --> 00:07:06,171
However complex a machine is,

121
00:07:06,171 --> 00:07:07,491
its underlying logic is fixed.

122
00:07:08,530 --> 00:07:10,290
Compared to coworkers
who smile to your face

123
00:07:10,530 --> 00:07:11,770
while hiding

124
00:07:11,770 --> 00:07:12,850
their real thoughts,

125
00:07:13,251 --> 00:07:13,956
it's way simpler.

126
00:07:16,011 --> 00:07:17,366
Do you have a boyfriend, Ms. Wen?

127
00:07:18,931 --> 00:07:19,371
Yes.

128
00:07:20,410 --> 00:07:21,131
But he's married.

129
00:07:21,970 --> 00:07:23,571
I didn't expect you to have

130
00:07:23,931 --> 00:07:24,811
such a unique taste.

131
00:07:25,931 --> 00:07:27,131
Aside from his status,

132
00:07:27,530 --> 00:07:28,770
he's just an ordinary man.

133
00:07:30,530 --> 00:07:31,691
My taste and yours

134
00:07:33,011 --> 00:07:33,931
aren't that different.

135
00:07:34,970 --> 00:07:36,530
I bet he promised

136
00:07:38,931 --> 00:07:40,131
he'd get a divorce for you.

137
00:07:46,770 --> 00:07:48,051
Of course not, Meng.

138
00:07:48,931 --> 00:07:49,691
Don't scare me.

139
00:07:51,090 --> 00:07:52,131
In my opinion,

140
00:07:52,571 --> 00:07:53,890
being someone's girlfriend

141
00:07:54,691 --> 00:07:56,330
and working for a company

142
00:07:56,650 --> 00:07:58,210
are essentially the same.

143
00:07:59,251 --> 00:08:00,650
You don't want to replace his wife

144
00:08:01,051 --> 00:08:02,650
or want any legal

145
00:08:03,131 --> 00:08:04,571
or moral commitment?

146
00:08:05,251 --> 00:08:05,931
Meng,

147
00:08:06,650 --> 00:08:07,571
do you really believe

148
00:08:07,731 --> 00:08:08,890
a man's promises?

149
00:08:09,530 --> 00:08:10,571
Then what are you after?

150
00:08:11,611 --> 00:08:12,090
True love?

151
00:08:13,090 --> 00:08:13,571
Thrills?

152
00:08:16,290 --> 00:08:16,931
A career move.

153
00:08:19,371 --> 00:08:20,090
You want money?

154
00:08:20,410 --> 00:08:21,090
Not money.

155
00:08:21,691 --> 00:08:22,371
But resources.

156
00:08:23,450 --> 00:08:24,890
Money is just currency.

157
00:08:25,251 --> 00:08:26,890
People are stepping stones.

158
00:08:28,371 --> 00:08:29,491
Unlike a woman like you,

159
00:08:29,611 --> 00:08:31,131
who was born lucky,

160
00:08:31,330 --> 00:08:33,371
I can't afford some romantic fairy tale

161
00:08:33,491 --> 00:08:34,251
where you

162
00:08:34,331 --> 00:08:35,331
risk everything for love.

163
00:08:36,050 --> 00:08:37,810
I only have two cards to play:

164
00:08:39,091 --> 00:08:40,731
youth and beauty.

165
00:08:40,971 --> 00:08:42,131
So while I'm still

166
00:08:42,331 --> 00:08:43,451
at the table,

167
00:08:43,971 --> 00:08:46,011
I have to play them well.

168
00:08:55,410 --> 00:08:57,331
Ms. Wen is a skilled pilot.

169
00:08:57,770 --> 00:08:58,611
Even in turbulence,

170
00:08:58,770 --> 00:08:59,810
she stays calm.

171
00:09:00,290 --> 00:09:00,930
I like her.

172
00:09:01,211 --> 00:09:02,410
Can she be my

173
00:09:02,491 --> 00:09:03,650
exclusive flight instructor?

174
00:09:03,770 --> 00:09:04,410
Of course.

175
00:09:05,971 --> 00:09:06,971
But

176
00:09:06,971 --> 00:09:08,251
something urgent came up today.

177
00:09:08,331 --> 00:09:09,131
I have to go abroad.

178
00:09:09,131 --> 00:09:10,971
I might be back in a week,

179
00:09:11,050 --> 00:09:13,011
or it could take a month.

180
00:09:13,491 --> 00:09:14,371
During this time,

181
00:09:14,690 --> 00:09:15,491
can you not assign her

182
00:09:15,491 --> 00:09:16,251
any other students?

183
00:09:18,091 --> 00:09:18,331
Wait.

184
00:09:18,851 --> 00:09:19,331
Well...

185
00:09:19,690 --> 00:09:20,451
I can pay for that.

186
00:09:20,451 --> 00:09:21,131
No problem.

187
00:09:21,690 --> 00:09:23,131
We'll make sure Ms. Wen

188
00:09:23,570 --> 00:09:24,731
is at your disposal anytime.

189
00:09:26,690 --> 00:09:28,170
I want to learn

190
00:09:28,211 --> 00:09:29,091
all about Ms. Wen's

191
00:09:29,690 --> 00:09:30,690
management skills.

192
00:09:33,211 --> 00:09:33,851
But if she never

193
00:09:33,890 --> 00:09:34,731
shows up for class,

194
00:09:34,810 --> 00:09:35,491
the fees will sit

195
00:09:35,491 --> 00:09:36,371
in the club's account.

196
00:09:36,410 --> 00:09:37,131
(You'll see Jiangzhou like never before)
I won't get paid,

197
00:09:37,131 --> 00:09:38,251
nor can I have new students.

198
00:09:38,331 --> 00:09:39,611
Who's covering my lost income?

199
00:09:41,451 --> 00:09:42,371
Didn't she say?

200
00:09:42,611 --> 00:09:43,451
She's going abroad

201
00:09:43,530 --> 00:09:44,690
and will be back for classes.

202
00:09:44,851 --> 00:09:45,611
Those are excuses.

203
00:09:45,650 --> 00:09:46,170
She's never

204
00:09:46,211 --> 00:09:46,971
coming back.

205
00:09:47,170 --> 00:09:48,011
How would you know?

206
00:09:48,650 --> 00:09:49,331
By your logic,

207
00:09:49,810 --> 00:09:50,851
she paid all that money

208
00:09:50,851 --> 00:09:51,530
for no classes

209
00:09:51,650 --> 00:09:52,731
just to block your schedule

210
00:09:52,731 --> 00:09:53,611
and mess with you?

211
00:09:54,011 --> 00:09:54,971
What's in it for her?

212
00:10:03,784 --> 00:10:05,224
(Add Visibility)

213
00:10:05,384 --> 00:10:06,504
(Select Friends Who Can See
Yu Meng)

214
00:10:06,984 --> 00:10:08,840
I have a business trip
next week. Be good.

215
00:10:19,930 --> 00:10:20,570
Mr. Jiao,

216
00:10:21,091 --> 00:10:22,211
what are you shooting here?

217
00:10:24,091 --> 00:10:24,650
You're here.

218
00:10:26,971 --> 00:10:28,170
You knew I was coming?

219
00:10:33,091 --> 00:10:34,731
Your assistant leaked

220
00:10:34,770 --> 00:10:36,131
his direct boss's schedule.

221
00:10:36,491 --> 00:10:37,770
You haven't trained him well.

222
00:10:38,011 --> 00:10:38,770
On the contrary,

223
00:10:39,050 --> 00:10:40,371
he executed the task

224
00:10:40,371 --> 00:10:41,331
I gave him perfectly.

225
00:10:41,731 --> 00:10:43,211
So you had him tell me

226
00:10:43,491 --> 00:10:44,211
where you'd be?

227
00:10:45,050 --> 00:10:45,731
I thought

228
00:10:46,011 --> 00:10:46,971
you should see

229
00:10:46,971 --> 00:10:47,973
my professional skills.

230
00:10:49,650 --> 00:10:50,251
That lady

231
00:10:50,251 --> 00:10:51,251
is my client.

232
00:10:52,211 --> 00:10:53,211
She and her husband

233
00:10:53,251 --> 00:10:54,322
are negotiating a divorce.

234
00:10:54,810 --> 00:10:56,371
The husband's lawyer claims

235
00:10:56,371 --> 00:10:57,582
the marriage is irreparable.

236
00:10:57,890 --> 00:10:58,890
But my client still

237
00:10:58,890 --> 00:10:59,650
needs more time

238
00:10:59,650 --> 00:11:01,091
to fight for child custody.

239
00:11:01,410 --> 00:11:01,810
So

240
00:11:02,170 --> 00:11:03,530
I had her invite her husband out

241
00:11:03,611 --> 00:11:04,731
in their child's name

242
00:11:04,930 --> 00:11:06,611
and put a box of Mid-Autumn

243
00:11:06,690 --> 00:11:07,451
mooncake gift sets

244
00:11:07,491 --> 00:11:08,770
in his trunk.

245
00:11:09,331 --> 00:11:10,170
It proves they still

246
00:11:10,251 --> 00:11:11,011
have feelings.

247
00:11:11,491 --> 00:11:13,611
But once a man's heart strays,

248
00:11:14,050 --> 00:11:15,611
even if she fights the divorce,

249
00:11:16,251 --> 00:11:17,211
what's the point?

250
00:11:17,491 --> 00:11:18,211
You misunderstand.

251
00:11:18,851 --> 00:11:19,971
She wants the divorce.

252
00:11:20,570 --> 00:11:21,930
Her ten-year-younger boyfriend

253
00:11:21,930 --> 00:11:23,211
keeps pushing her every day.

254
00:11:23,611 --> 00:11:24,611
He can't wait.

255
00:11:25,050 --> 00:11:25,930
Her boyfriend?

256
00:11:28,690 --> 00:11:29,650
So she cheated?

257
00:11:31,371 --> 00:11:31,930
And you're helping her?

258
00:11:31,930 --> 00:11:32,611
I know very well

259
00:11:32,611 --> 00:11:33,690
what you've been up to.

260
00:11:34,170 --> 00:11:35,331
You're blaming me?

261
00:11:35,530 --> 00:11:36,290
You put on a persona

262
00:11:36,290 --> 00:11:37,251
before marrying me.

263
00:11:37,611 --> 00:11:39,011
Don't change the subject.

264
00:11:39,011 --> 00:11:40,050
We're talking about you.

265
00:11:40,410 --> 00:11:41,251
Looks like I struck

266
00:11:41,251 --> 00:11:42,050
a nerve.

267
00:11:42,650 --> 00:11:43,451
You've been

268
00:11:43,451 --> 00:11:44,650
a hypocrite to the core.

269
00:11:44,851 --> 00:11:45,770
I'm a hypocrite?

270
00:11:45,971 --> 00:11:47,290
At least I'm not the one

271
00:11:47,331 --> 00:11:48,050
cheating around.

272
00:11:48,131 --> 00:11:49,170
You disgust me.

273
00:11:49,611 --> 00:11:50,344
- See?
- I disgust you?

274
00:11:50,971 --> 00:11:51,851
Once a couple

275
00:11:51,851 --> 00:11:52,890
reaches the divorce stage,

276
00:11:53,290 --> 00:11:55,283
it's not because
they don't understand each other,

277
00:11:55,731 --> 00:11:57,131
but rather because

278
00:11:57,530 --> 00:11:58,731
they finally do.

279
00:12:02,251 --> 00:12:03,331
No wonder your law firm

280
00:12:03,371 --> 00:12:04,290
recommended you,

281
00:12:04,371 --> 00:12:05,690
calling you the most professional

282
00:12:05,690 --> 00:12:06,451
top lawyer.

283
00:12:07,611 --> 00:12:08,851
Turns out they meant

284
00:12:08,930 --> 00:12:10,131
you're the top expert

285
00:12:10,570 --> 00:12:11,611
in low morals

286
00:12:11,650 --> 00:12:12,851
and twisted sophistry.

287
00:12:13,770 --> 00:12:14,971
I have high morals.

288
00:12:15,410 --> 00:12:16,451
My moral baseline

289
00:12:16,530 --> 00:12:18,050
is serving my clients

290
00:12:18,091 --> 00:12:18,890
unconditionally.

291
00:12:19,752 --> 00:12:20,680
(I'm Jiao Xu. Call me for your divorce.
You need to find out the mistress.)

292
00:12:20,810 --> 00:12:21,451
(Words can lie, but scents never do.)
Does this still stand?

293
00:12:22,451 --> 00:12:22,930
Of course.

294
00:12:24,011 --> 00:12:25,170
But let me be clear up front:

295
00:12:25,491 --> 00:12:26,170
I'm expensive.

296
00:12:26,570 --> 00:12:27,371
It sounds like

297
00:12:27,570 --> 00:12:29,211
your main goal isn't divorce, Ms. Yu.

298
00:12:30,890 --> 00:12:32,410
I want you to secure proof

299
00:12:32,491 --> 00:12:33,371
of his cheating first.

300
00:12:33,530 --> 00:12:34,770
Then we'll discuss the divorce.

301
00:12:34,890 --> 00:12:35,611
Ms. Yu,

302
00:12:36,331 --> 00:12:37,810
I sympathize with your situation,

303
00:12:38,011 --> 00:12:38,690
but I only handle

304
00:12:38,731 --> 00:12:39,570
things in court.

305
00:12:40,410 --> 00:12:41,650
The fee I'm offering

306
00:12:41,890 --> 00:12:43,611
is twice your usual rate.

307
00:12:52,211 --> 00:12:52,810
Three times.

308
00:12:54,810 --> 00:12:55,530
Four times.

309
00:12:58,170 --> 00:12:59,371
I've seen men

310
00:12:59,611 --> 00:13:01,251
marry for their father-in-law
the first time

311
00:13:01,251 --> 00:13:02,422
and for true love the second.

312
00:13:02,690 --> 00:13:03,410
Rest assured,

313
00:13:03,770 --> 00:13:05,451
I have plenty of relevant experience.

314
00:13:07,131 --> 00:13:08,211
Then I'm counting on you.

315
00:13:11,371 --> 00:13:12,211
From what you said,

316
00:13:12,251 --> 00:13:12,851
your husband

317
00:13:12,851 --> 00:13:14,050
has been cheating for a while.

318
00:13:14,570 --> 00:13:15,491
The other woman knows

319
00:13:15,491 --> 00:13:16,371
he's married,

320
00:13:16,410 --> 00:13:17,371
yet she still boldly

321
00:13:17,410 --> 00:13:18,570
shows up in front of you.

322
00:13:18,690 --> 00:13:19,371
That shows

323
00:13:19,890 --> 00:13:21,170
their relationship is stable.

324
00:13:21,930 --> 00:13:22,611
So morning jogs

325
00:13:23,091 --> 00:13:23,890
might be their

326
00:13:23,890 --> 00:13:25,251
tacitly agreed rendezvous time.

327
00:13:25,331 --> 00:13:26,011
Mr. Jiao,

328
00:13:26,451 --> 00:13:28,050
I'm paying you four times your rate.

329
00:13:28,211 --> 00:13:28,930
Can you tell me

330
00:13:28,971 --> 00:13:30,050
something of actual value?

331
00:13:30,371 --> 00:13:31,731
I already know all of this.

332
00:13:32,290 --> 00:13:34,170
Think back on his recent behavior.

333
00:13:34,451 --> 00:13:35,570
Has he randomly bought you

334
00:13:35,650 --> 00:13:36,611
expensive gifts

335
00:13:36,650 --> 00:13:38,251
or made passionate confessions of love?

336
00:13:38,770 --> 00:13:39,371
Maybe that's

337
00:13:39,371 --> 00:13:40,371
guilt from cheating.

338
00:13:41,211 --> 00:13:42,650
We've always been happy together.

339
00:13:43,491 --> 00:13:43,930
No,

340
00:13:44,451 --> 00:13:45,331
rather,

341
00:13:45,971 --> 00:13:47,371
I thought we'd been happy together.

342
00:13:47,971 --> 00:13:49,371
He tells me he loves me every day

343
00:13:49,611 --> 00:13:50,851
and always gives me gifts.

344
00:13:51,290 --> 00:13:53,131
So what you mentioned

345
00:13:53,451 --> 00:13:54,410
might not apply at all.

346
00:13:54,650 --> 00:13:55,930
So your social media posts

347
00:13:56,011 --> 00:13:57,011
are all real?

348
00:13:58,930 --> 00:14:00,050
I thought it was a persona.

349
00:14:00,371 --> 00:14:01,690
I used to truly believe

350
00:14:02,011 --> 00:14:02,731
I was just

351
00:14:02,731 --> 00:14:03,971
a woman born lucky.

352
00:14:05,251 --> 00:14:06,251
But this very persona

353
00:14:06,331 --> 00:14:07,011
made me spiral

354
00:14:07,290 --> 00:14:08,290
step-by-step

355
00:14:08,690 --> 00:14:10,211
into where I am today.

356
00:14:10,810 --> 00:14:11,770
The "born lucky" label

357
00:14:11,851 --> 00:14:13,050
is indeed deceptive.

358
00:14:13,731 --> 00:14:15,690
It makes you mistake your own abilities

359
00:14:15,770 --> 00:14:17,251
for sheer luck.

360
00:14:18,050 --> 00:14:18,530
But

361
00:14:20,211 --> 00:14:21,971
when life takes a turn,

362
00:14:22,050 --> 00:14:23,211
and you wake up

363
00:14:23,211 --> 00:14:24,530
and bravely walk out of an abyss,

364
00:14:25,170 --> 00:14:26,050
how is that not

365
00:14:26,091 --> 00:14:26,851
good luck too?

366
00:14:28,851 --> 00:14:30,011
That makes some sense.

367
00:14:31,371 --> 00:14:32,650
I thought you were

368
00:14:32,731 --> 00:14:33,890
a refined scoundrel,

369
00:14:34,530 --> 00:14:36,011
but turns out you're...

370
00:14:37,810 --> 00:14:38,930
What's that word again?

371
00:14:39,011 --> 00:14:39,764
Overly brilliant?

372
00:14:40,930 --> 00:14:41,971
Dashing and charming?

373
00:14:43,211 --> 00:14:44,611
Gentle and refined?

374
00:14:44,770 --> 00:14:45,578
A woman's best ally.

375
00:14:48,290 --> 00:14:48,851
Mr. Jiao,

376
00:14:49,410 --> 00:14:50,331
one last question.

377
00:14:50,890 --> 00:14:51,770
If I gather

378
00:14:51,851 --> 00:14:53,290
all the evidence of his cheating,

379
00:14:54,251 --> 00:14:55,371
can he be left with nothing?

380
00:14:56,650 --> 00:14:56,971
No.

381
00:14:57,611 --> 00:14:58,491
The at-fault party

382
00:14:58,570 --> 00:14:59,530
gets a smaller share

383
00:14:59,530 --> 00:15:00,731
but not zero during division.

384
00:15:01,170 --> 00:15:01,570
Also,

385
00:15:01,690 --> 00:15:02,731
if the assets you mean

386
00:15:02,810 --> 00:15:04,251
include your family's company,

387
00:15:04,770 --> 00:15:05,650
it's more complicated.

388
00:15:06,290 --> 00:15:07,770
But he doesn't own anything.

389
00:15:08,331 --> 00:15:09,650
All our family company shares

390
00:15:09,890 --> 00:15:10,731
are held by my dad.

391
00:15:11,731 --> 00:15:12,690
Speaking of which,

392
00:15:15,131 --> 00:15:16,410
how is your father's

393
00:15:16,971 --> 00:15:17,570
health?

394
00:15:18,770 --> 00:15:19,570
He's doing great.

395
00:15:20,451 --> 00:15:20,890
Why?

396
00:15:21,890 --> 00:15:23,251
Then what about your lock screen?

397
00:15:24,616 --> 00:15:25,896
(Long Life for Dad)

398
00:15:27,451 --> 00:15:28,530
I just don't want

399
00:15:29,211 --> 00:15:29,851
to hustle.

400
00:15:30,331 --> 00:15:32,011
I hope my dad lives to a hundred,

401
00:15:32,251 --> 00:15:33,371
so I can just coast.

402
00:15:35,690 --> 00:15:36,851
An ambitious dream.

403
00:15:37,211 --> 00:15:37,890
Mr. Jiao,

404
00:15:38,290 --> 00:15:39,650
can you actually help me or not?

405
00:15:40,050 --> 00:15:41,131
What are my chances?

406
00:15:42,971 --> 00:15:44,251
Considering you've been detached

407
00:15:44,290 --> 00:15:45,851
from company operations for so long

408
00:15:45,971 --> 00:15:46,491
and have no control

409
00:15:46,491 --> 00:15:47,662
over the household finances,

410
00:15:48,211 --> 00:15:48,930
to be honest,

411
00:15:49,690 --> 00:15:50,676
your chances are slim.

412
00:15:53,371 --> 00:15:53,770
But

413
00:15:54,930 --> 00:15:55,890
that's also why

414
00:15:55,890 --> 00:15:56,930
I took this case.

415
00:15:57,611 --> 00:15:59,091
I hate anything too easy.

416
00:16:00,050 --> 00:16:00,770
Ms. Yu,

417
00:16:01,371 --> 00:16:02,331
divorce is

418
00:16:02,331 --> 00:16:03,810
a bloodless war of human nature.

419
00:16:05,011 --> 00:16:06,091
Are you ready to fight it?

420
00:16:08,232 --> 00:16:09,288
(Wen Xiaoxiao)

421
00:16:09,800 --> 00:16:10,376
(Dongji Island
Feel the free romance at 30° N)

422
00:16:15,091 --> 00:16:16,410
Meng, did you go on a trip?

423
00:16:19,211 --> 00:16:19,770
No.

424
00:16:20,131 --> 00:16:20,690
(Dongji Island)
Someone else posted it.

425
00:16:21,451 --> 00:16:22,690
I wanted to go to Dongji Island too.

426
00:16:22,690 --> 00:16:23,679
I thought you went there

427
00:16:23,890 --> 00:16:25,091
and was going to ask

428
00:16:25,091 --> 00:16:25,690
how it was.

429
00:16:26,971 --> 00:16:27,851
(Honey,)

430
00:16:29,170 --> 00:16:30,570
where are you heading this time?

431
00:16:31,971 --> 00:16:32,690
Dongji Island.

432
00:16:32,971 --> 00:16:33,770
With a few clients.

433
00:16:35,131 --> 00:16:36,011
That far?

434
00:16:40,451 --> 00:16:41,890
Take me with you.

435
00:16:43,930 --> 00:16:44,690
The forecast says

436
00:16:44,770 --> 00:16:45,810
it's been raining there.

437
00:16:46,690 --> 00:16:47,530
If you go,

438
00:16:47,971 --> 00:16:49,371
you'll have to bundle up tight.

439
00:16:50,410 --> 00:16:51,251
Then I won't go.

440
00:17:01,251 --> 00:17:02,251
Why pack a camera?

441
00:17:02,890 --> 00:17:03,971
You rarely bring a camera

442
00:17:03,971 --> 00:17:04,530
for business.

443
00:17:04,971 --> 00:17:06,171
One client's hobby

444
00:17:06,251 --> 00:17:06,971
is photography.

445
00:17:07,330 --> 00:17:08,891
I borrowed it from Dad especially,

446
00:17:09,850 --> 00:17:11,090
thinking a shared hobby

447
00:17:11,491 --> 00:17:12,290
would break the ice.

448
00:17:13,770 --> 00:17:14,691
Then your first photo

449
00:17:14,731 --> 00:17:15,931
has to be of me.

450
00:17:16,731 --> 00:17:17,451
Take one of me.

451
00:17:34,251 --> 00:17:35,411
Dad, Mom,

452
00:17:35,810 --> 00:17:36,691
I'm back.

453
00:17:37,411 --> 00:17:38,090
- Meng.
- Mom.

454
00:17:39,451 --> 00:17:39,931
Ms. Hui.

455
00:17:40,330 --> 00:17:41,130
It's Thursday.

456
00:17:41,171 --> 00:17:42,651
There's a Wuqinxi class this afternoon.

457
00:17:42,651 --> 00:17:43,491
They went to it.

458
00:17:44,251 --> 00:17:45,370
Will you stay for dinner?

459
00:17:45,451 --> 00:17:45,931
I'll make

460
00:17:45,971 --> 00:17:46,691
your favorite

461
00:17:46,731 --> 00:17:47,597
duck soup with bamboo shoots.

462
00:17:48,411 --> 00:17:49,130
Thanks, Ms. Hui.

463
00:17:49,610 --> 00:17:50,810
I want to take a nap first.

464
00:17:51,090 --> 00:17:52,770
I'll eat when I wake up.

465
00:17:52,850 --> 00:17:53,486
Don't wake me.

466
00:17:55,651 --> 00:17:56,891
You're napping in the study?

467
00:17:57,451 --> 00:17:58,330
I put fresh sheets

468
00:17:58,370 --> 00:17:59,411
on your bed.

469
00:18:01,651 --> 00:18:02,570
The study is sunny.

470
00:18:02,810 --> 00:18:03,691
It's cozier there.

471
00:18:28,370 --> 00:18:28,891
Mr. Di,

472
00:18:29,090 --> 00:18:29,810
you're here too?

473
00:18:30,240 --> 00:18:30,770
Should I make

474
00:18:30,770 --> 00:18:31,610
your dinner as well?

475
00:18:32,491 --> 00:18:33,090
Is Meng here?

476
00:18:33,570 --> 00:18:34,130
She just came,

477
00:18:34,370 --> 00:18:35,171
right before you.

478
00:18:37,651 --> 00:18:39,130
Meng is sleeping in the study.

479
00:18:39,731 --> 00:18:40,290
She was tried

480
00:18:40,411 --> 00:18:41,370
and specifically said

481
00:18:41,570 --> 00:18:42,211
not to wake her.

482
00:18:42,570 --> 00:18:43,530
Sleeping in the study?

483
00:18:45,931 --> 00:18:46,691
That won't do.

484
00:18:48,691 --> 00:18:50,411
I'll go check
so she doesn't catch a chill.

485
00:19:07,971 --> 00:19:09,731
No portraits, only scenery shots.

486
00:19:10,491 --> 00:19:11,691
People usually take photos

487
00:19:12,011 --> 00:19:13,251
with clients, right?

488
00:19:13,491 --> 00:19:14,570
Even if they were terrible,

489
00:19:14,570 --> 00:19:15,769
he wouldn't delete them all.

490
00:19:16,011 --> 00:19:16,971
This is so strange.

491
00:19:23,171 --> 00:19:23,610
Mr. Di,

492
00:19:24,011 --> 00:19:25,644
Meng wanted
duck soup with bamboo shoots.

493
00:19:25,850 --> 00:19:27,050
I'll add some cordyceps.

494
00:19:27,251 --> 00:19:28,017
Will you have some?

495
00:19:34,411 --> 00:19:36,731
Honey, what are you talking about?

496
00:19:36,850 --> 00:19:38,011
You woke me up.

497
00:19:38,651 --> 00:19:39,491
My fault.

498
00:19:40,011 --> 00:19:41,130
I brought you a blanket

499
00:19:41,171 --> 00:19:42,113
in case you got cold.

500
00:19:45,411 --> 00:19:46,850
I'm up anyway.

501
00:19:47,050 --> 00:19:47,885
Let's go upstairs.

502
00:19:48,651 --> 00:19:49,011
Okay.

503
00:20:06,728 --> 00:20:08,008
(Boya Center)

504
00:20:19,731 --> 00:20:20,211
Sorry,

505
00:20:20,211 --> 00:20:21,211
I thought it was my ride.

506
00:20:22,050 --> 00:20:23,011
Since you're here,

507
00:20:23,570 --> 00:20:24,330
let me drive you.

508
00:20:28,810 --> 00:20:29,610
Thanks, Meng.

509
00:20:35,090 --> 00:20:36,246
Did you enjoy Dongji Island?

510
00:20:36,850 --> 00:20:37,370
It was great.

511
00:20:41,691 --> 00:20:43,090
I heard Dongji Island

512
00:20:43,370 --> 00:20:44,850
is a place you go with a partner.

513
00:20:45,130 --> 00:20:45,939
Were you with yours?

514
00:20:46,770 --> 00:20:47,211
Yes.

515
00:20:48,090 --> 00:20:48,691
Ms. Wen,

516
00:20:49,570 --> 00:20:50,651
what does it feel like

517
00:20:50,731 --> 00:20:51,610
to date a married man?

518
00:20:52,491 --> 00:20:52,891
What did

519
00:20:52,891 --> 00:20:53,810
he say about his wife?

520
00:20:54,731 --> 00:20:55,370
He said

521
00:20:55,891 --> 00:20:57,090
they've been deeply in love.

522
00:20:57,891 --> 00:20:59,130
Then I understand even less.

523
00:21:00,610 --> 00:21:02,109
Don't you worry that she'll find out?

524
00:21:04,330 --> 00:21:05,251
I'd waited for her

525
00:21:05,290 --> 00:21:06,090
to come to me.

526
00:21:06,850 --> 00:21:07,491
And today,

527
00:21:10,570 --> 00:21:11,211
she did.

528
00:21:14,451 --> 00:21:15,850
So that Moments post

529
00:21:16,651 --> 00:21:17,810
was intentional?

530
00:21:18,731 --> 00:21:20,090
It was to show my sincerity.

531
00:21:20,491 --> 00:21:21,451
You wanted to lure me out

532
00:21:21,451 --> 00:21:22,405
and force a showdown?

533
00:21:24,810 --> 00:21:25,971
I wanted to apologize to you,

534
00:21:25,971 --> 00:21:26,491
Meng.

535
00:21:28,090 --> 00:21:29,530
I followed your social media

536
00:21:31,330 --> 00:21:32,330
and looked at your posts.

537
00:21:32,610 --> 00:21:33,691
I know you love Mr. Di

538
00:21:34,251 --> 00:21:35,731
and what I did must have hurt you.

539
00:21:36,451 --> 00:21:37,411
But I want to say,

540
00:21:38,171 --> 00:21:39,330
when a man cheats,

541
00:21:40,370 --> 00:21:41,290
even if it weren't me,

542
00:21:41,891 --> 00:21:42,829
it'd be someone else.

543
00:21:44,011 --> 00:21:44,691
At least

544
00:21:46,530 --> 00:21:47,563
I don't want your place.

545
00:21:48,290 --> 00:21:49,171
Ms. Wen,

546
00:21:49,451 --> 00:21:50,971
are you implying

547
00:21:51,530 --> 00:21:52,651
I should thank you?

548
00:21:52,971 --> 00:21:54,050
I want to thank you.

549
00:21:58,891 --> 00:21:59,330
Let me

550
00:21:59,330 --> 00:22:00,330
treat you to dinner.

551
00:22:18,370 --> 00:22:19,491
Let me show you around.

552
00:22:19,971 --> 00:22:21,530
Some of these were bought by Mr. Di,

553
00:22:22,050 --> 00:22:22,810
so half is yours.

554
00:22:23,411 --> 00:22:23,931
Feel free.

555
00:22:54,090 --> 00:22:55,610
Not a single designer brand.

556
00:22:56,251 --> 00:22:57,090
Pure romance?

557
00:22:57,610 --> 00:22:58,731
At one point,

558
00:22:58,810 --> 00:23:00,067
I fancied designer brands too,

559
00:23:01,130 --> 00:23:02,570
but then I found them meaningless.

560
00:23:03,050 --> 00:23:03,669
So I sold them.

561
00:23:04,891 --> 00:23:06,011
Were your previous bosses

562
00:23:07,290 --> 00:23:08,570
other women's husbands too?

563
00:23:09,090 --> 00:23:09,530
Yes.

564
00:23:13,530 --> 00:23:14,850
Did Di Liren

565
00:23:15,691 --> 00:23:17,011
leave anything behind here?

566
00:23:21,651 --> 00:23:22,731
His only belonging here

567
00:23:26,530 --> 00:23:27,130
is this.

568
00:23:27,770 --> 00:23:28,971
Not even a piece of clothing?

569
00:23:29,850 --> 00:23:30,891
I know it's a lot to take,

570
00:23:31,810 --> 00:23:33,770
but the only thing here for him to wear

571
00:23:33,891 --> 00:23:34,570
is this.

572
00:23:35,251 --> 00:23:36,276
He never stays the night.

573
00:23:38,090 --> 00:23:39,651
He already wears this thing.

574
00:23:40,530 --> 00:23:41,731
Does that even matter?

575
00:23:42,050 --> 00:23:43,011
It's different.

576
00:23:44,411 --> 00:23:45,681
At least he cares about family.

577
00:23:46,251 --> 00:23:47,103
He's a good husband.

578
00:23:49,256 --> 00:23:51,720
(Honey)

579
00:23:52,171 --> 00:23:52,610
Hello?

580
00:23:53,290 --> 00:23:53,731
Honey,

581
00:23:54,171 --> 00:23:55,330
my work dinner was canceled.

582
00:23:55,691 --> 00:23:56,770
Mr. Liu's stomach acted up.

583
00:23:57,011 --> 00:23:57,850
I'm on my way home

584
00:23:58,171 --> 00:23:58,850
to take you out

585
00:23:58,891 --> 00:24:00,330
for your favorite Chaozhou food,

586
00:24:00,370 --> 00:24:00,731
okay?

587
00:24:01,810 --> 00:24:02,610
I've booked a table.

588
00:24:02,691 --> 00:24:04,050
No need. I have plans.

589
00:24:04,731 --> 00:24:05,370
Honey,

590
00:24:05,411 --> 00:24:07,050
we haven't had a date in days.

591
00:24:07,290 --> 00:24:08,570
Are you seeing someone else?

592
00:24:08,731 --> 00:24:09,290
Yeah.

593
00:24:09,691 --> 00:24:10,423
What will you do?

594
00:24:11,491 --> 00:24:12,731
Then it must be my fault.

595
00:24:13,050 --> 00:24:14,130
I upset you,

596
00:24:14,130 --> 00:24:15,264
pushing you to someone else.

597
00:24:16,171 --> 00:24:17,691
I know you love me most.

598
00:24:18,370 --> 00:24:19,810
You must be at Liu Zi's

599
00:24:19,850 --> 00:24:20,570
with Chestnut,

600
00:24:20,570 --> 00:24:20,971
right?

601
00:24:21,850 --> 00:24:22,530
When you're done,

602
00:24:22,651 --> 00:24:23,610
I'll pick you up.

603
00:24:24,931 --> 00:24:25,891
Liu Zi will drive me.

604
00:24:26,011 --> 00:24:26,891
I need to go.

605
00:24:29,211 --> 00:24:29,850
Let's eat.

606
00:24:34,451 --> 00:24:35,891
Does he know you asked me over

607
00:24:36,370 --> 00:24:37,011
for dinner?

608
00:24:37,411 --> 00:24:38,251
How could he know?

609
00:24:38,891 --> 00:24:40,211
I genuinely wanted to treat you

610
00:24:40,411 --> 00:24:41,130
to dinner.

611
00:24:45,850 --> 00:24:47,171
I usually order takeout,

612
00:24:47,651 --> 00:24:48,810
but I tell men

613
00:24:49,370 --> 00:24:50,090
I made it myself.

614
00:24:54,050 --> 00:24:55,931
With all these little tricks
you play on men,

615
00:24:56,411 --> 00:24:57,130
it's no wonder.

616
00:24:57,530 --> 00:24:58,171
Aren't men just

617
00:24:58,570 --> 00:24:59,050
looking for

618
00:24:59,050 --> 00:25:00,050
emotional validation?

619
00:25:00,971 --> 00:25:01,810
As for the process,

620
00:25:02,491 --> 00:25:03,155
who truly cares?

621
00:25:03,610 --> 00:25:05,370
You invited me here.

622
00:25:05,810 --> 00:25:06,770
It wasn't just

623
00:25:07,011 --> 00:25:08,171
to treat me

624
00:25:08,211 --> 00:25:08,810
to some soup.

625
00:25:09,491 --> 00:25:10,050
Out with it.

626
00:25:11,290 --> 00:25:11,971
What do you want?

627
00:25:15,130 --> 00:25:16,171
I want a job offer letter.

628
00:25:17,770 --> 00:25:19,130
You mean

629
00:25:19,610 --> 00:25:21,090
you broke up my marriage,

630
00:25:21,211 --> 00:25:22,211
and now you want me

631
00:25:22,610 --> 00:25:23,850
to set you up with a job?

632
00:25:26,088 --> 00:25:27,624
(Nuisance Call)

633
00:25:35,011 --> 00:25:35,491
Babe,

634
00:25:36,090 --> 00:25:36,770
are you home?

635
00:25:37,130 --> 00:25:38,130
She went out tonight.

636
00:25:38,530 --> 00:25:39,491
I'm coming over now.

637
00:25:39,720 --> 00:25:40,552
(Nuisance Call)

638
00:25:40,810 --> 00:25:41,491
Should I let him?

639
00:25:42,330 --> 00:25:43,137
I do what you say.

640
00:25:49,011 --> 00:25:50,011
I'm out

641
00:25:51,731 --> 00:25:52,411
with a friend.

642
00:25:53,211 --> 00:25:53,651
Can I

643
00:25:53,651 --> 00:25:54,651
steal you away

644
00:25:54,691 --> 00:25:55,406
from your friend?

645
00:25:56,171 --> 00:25:57,130
No.

646
00:25:58,330 --> 00:25:58,971
If I gave in

647
00:25:58,971 --> 00:26:00,130
to your every whim,

648
00:26:00,691 --> 00:26:02,011
the thrill would be gone.

649
00:26:03,211 --> 00:26:03,691
Bye.

650
00:26:09,770 --> 00:26:10,530
I can tell.

651
00:26:13,090 --> 00:26:13,928
You love him a lot.

652
00:26:17,770 --> 00:26:18,451
Since

653
00:26:18,971 --> 00:26:20,330
you know how to handle him,

654
00:26:20,931 --> 00:26:21,971
why don't you just ask him

655
00:26:21,971 --> 00:26:22,610
for the offer?

656
00:26:22,971 --> 00:26:24,810
He has been feeding me empty promises.

657
00:26:25,370 --> 00:26:26,651
From the day we met,

658
00:26:26,810 --> 00:26:28,211
he promised me so much.

659
00:26:28,850 --> 00:26:30,130
But promises

660
00:26:30,530 --> 00:26:32,411
are just cheap talks.

661
00:26:33,451 --> 00:26:34,290
Who knows

662
00:26:34,651 --> 00:26:35,290
if he delivers?

663
00:26:36,610 --> 00:26:37,971
You distrust him that much?

664
00:26:40,610 --> 00:26:42,491
Has he kept all the promises

665
00:26:43,251 --> 00:26:44,011
he made to you?

666
00:26:45,171 --> 00:26:46,491
Then why should I believe

667
00:26:46,530 --> 00:26:47,651
the promises he made to me

668
00:26:47,931 --> 00:26:49,050
will ever come true?

669
00:26:49,891 --> 00:26:50,731
Since I now have

670
00:26:50,731 --> 00:26:51,651
a better choice,

671
00:26:53,290 --> 00:26:54,451
why not seize it?

672
00:26:57,651 --> 00:26:58,251
Forget it.

673
00:26:58,651 --> 00:26:59,850
After all that talk,

674
00:27:00,211 --> 00:27:01,411
I don't see any sincerity.

675
00:27:02,850 --> 00:27:03,891
It's pointless.

676
00:27:05,651 --> 00:27:06,731
Aren't you eating?

677
00:27:08,411 --> 00:27:08,810
Right.

678
00:27:09,651 --> 00:27:10,931
Think carefully

679
00:27:11,330 --> 00:27:12,810
about what you're trading with me.

680
00:27:13,651 --> 00:27:14,370
Bye.

681
00:27:30,731 --> 00:27:31,570
Why?

682
00:27:32,616 --> 00:27:41,320
(Five years ago, Xiaocheng)

683
00:27:46,330 --> 00:27:47,171
Are you all right?

684
00:27:50,610 --> 00:27:50,971
Here.

685
00:27:52,971 --> 00:27:53,370
Okay.

686
00:27:54,050 --> 00:27:54,850
I called the police

687
00:27:55,011 --> 00:27:55,850
and an ambulance.

688
00:27:56,411 --> 00:27:57,211
Thank you.

689
00:27:58,211 --> 00:27:59,370
What's your name?

690
00:27:59,411 --> 00:28:00,451
Stop! Don't run!

691
00:28:01,576 --> 00:28:06,280
♪If choices must be made♪

692
00:28:07,770 --> 00:28:08,605
(It's all my fault.)

693
00:28:09,931 --> 00:28:11,691
Why did I agree
to let you visit the factory?

694
00:28:12,891 --> 00:28:13,850
It's just a raw material

695
00:28:13,891 --> 00:28:14,931
factory in Xiaocheng.

696
00:28:14,971 --> 00:28:15,810
What's there to see?

697
00:28:15,810 --> 00:28:16,290
Look at you,

698
00:28:16,971 --> 00:28:17,891
getting hurt like this.

699
00:28:18,050 --> 00:28:19,090
Did they catch the driver?

700
00:28:19,251 --> 00:28:20,370
I heard a kind man

701
00:28:20,411 --> 00:28:21,050
caught him

702
00:28:21,370 --> 00:28:22,610
and took him to the police.

703
00:28:23,330 --> 00:28:24,491
He seemed to be injured too.

704
00:28:25,330 --> 00:28:26,651
But he didn't leave a name.

705
00:28:26,691 --> 00:28:27,850
No one knows who he is.

706
00:28:31,610 --> 00:28:32,570
So noisy.

707
00:28:35,971 --> 00:28:36,810
So annoying.

708
00:28:42,810 --> 00:28:43,491
It's you.

709
00:28:45,850 --> 00:28:46,290
Hello.

710
00:28:47,130 --> 00:28:47,891
I'm Di Liren.

711
00:28:58,171 --> 00:28:59,050
I'm so sorry.

712
00:28:59,251 --> 00:29:00,691
You got hurt because you chased

713
00:29:00,971 --> 00:29:01,891
that driver.

714
00:29:03,891 --> 00:29:04,770
Justice was served.

715
00:29:05,090 --> 00:29:06,011
The injury is worth it.

716
00:29:07,691 --> 00:29:09,171
Since you won't go back to the ward,

717
00:29:09,651 --> 00:29:10,290
then

718
00:29:13,530 --> 00:29:14,611
let me take you somewhere.

719
00:29:15,290 --> 00:29:15,850
Where?

720
00:29:27,211 --> 00:29:28,530
I finally made it up.

721
00:29:29,011 --> 00:29:29,451
Three,

722
00:29:30,530 --> 00:29:31,050
two,

723
00:29:32,011 --> 00:29:32,370
one.

724
00:29:33,251 --> 00:29:33,610
Look.

725
00:29:38,050 --> 00:29:39,211
This is so gorgeous.

726
00:29:41,731 --> 00:29:42,891
Quick, over here.

727
00:29:43,491 --> 00:29:43,971
Stop!

728
00:29:44,570 --> 00:29:45,011
Don't run!

729
00:29:45,130 --> 00:29:45,530
Stop!

730
00:29:47,171 --> 00:29:47,810
I see you!

731
00:29:48,451 --> 00:29:49,067
Where are they?

732
00:29:49,891 --> 00:29:50,553
Where are they?

733
00:29:54,888 --> 00:29:58,408
♪I was never the clever one♪

734
00:29:58,632 --> 00:30:02,120
♪Just trying to live with heart♪

735
00:30:02,248 --> 00:30:08,104
♪To love, to hate,
to seek a more genuine soul♪

736
00:30:08,264 --> 00:30:12,936
♪Some embrace while some turn cold♪

737
00:30:12,936 --> 00:30:18,568
♪The ones who stay are the sincerest♪

738
00:30:22,810 --> 00:30:24,651
If someone had told me a few days ago

739
00:30:25,971 --> 00:30:26,651
that I'd meet

740
00:30:26,691 --> 00:30:27,931
a wonderful girl

741
00:30:29,731 --> 00:30:30,731
at the cost of

742
00:30:31,411 --> 00:30:32,050
being injured,

743
00:30:32,931 --> 00:30:33,538
hospitalized,

744
00:30:34,251 --> 00:30:35,398
and falling behind at work,

745
00:30:36,171 --> 00:30:37,570
yet my heart would feel

746
00:30:37,610 --> 00:30:38,211
restless,

747
00:30:39,290 --> 00:30:39,931
concerned,

748
00:30:40,971 --> 00:30:41,570
and anxious,

749
00:30:43,011 --> 00:30:43,570
even if it were

750
00:30:43,570 --> 00:30:44,610
just a brief encounter,

751
00:30:45,050 --> 00:30:46,610
and we'd never meet again,

752
00:30:48,810 --> 00:30:49,411
I think

753
00:30:52,050 --> 00:30:53,451
I would make the same choice.

754
00:30:57,610 --> 00:30:58,171
Because this is

755
00:30:58,171 --> 00:30:59,411
a gift from heaven.

756
00:31:03,816 --> 00:31:11,048
♪We cannot let go♪

757
00:31:30,088 --> 00:31:33,768
♪I was never the clever one♪

758
00:31:33,768 --> 00:31:37,320
♪Just trying to live with heart♪

759
00:31:37,320 --> 00:31:43,400
♪To love, to hate,
to seek a more genuine soul♪

760
00:31:43,560 --> 00:31:48,232
♪Some embrace while some turn cold♪

761
00:31:48,232 --> 00:31:53,768
♪The ones who stay are the sincerest♪

762
00:31:54,504 --> 00:32:01,416
♪We cannot let go♪

763
00:32:06,810 --> 00:32:08,330
Do you have anything to say to me?

764
00:32:11,971 --> 00:32:12,610
See you in Jiangzhou.

765
00:32:29,530 --> 00:32:30,211
Liar.

766
00:32:31,810 --> 00:32:33,290
Liar. Di Liren.

767
00:32:33,451 --> 00:32:34,570
You liar!

768
00:32:35,370 --> 00:32:36,171
You scumbag!

769
00:33:22,931 --> 00:33:23,570
Surprise!

770
00:33:24,651 --> 00:33:26,251
Three, two, one.

771
00:33:27,290 --> 00:33:28,011
Stop doing this.

772
00:33:28,610 --> 00:33:30,130
Cleaning up is such a hassle.

773
00:33:37,651 --> 00:33:38,090
Honey,

774
00:33:39,011 --> 00:33:40,516
happy anniversary of the day we met!

775
00:33:43,370 --> 00:33:44,770
I had terrible luck that day.

776
00:33:45,130 --> 00:33:46,330
I can't be happy about it.

777
00:33:46,971 --> 00:33:48,090
It was a rough day,

778
00:33:48,530 --> 00:33:49,770
but the ending was perfect.

779
00:33:50,171 --> 00:33:51,770
I remember you were in a car accident,

780
00:33:52,171 --> 00:33:53,290
and I got injured too.

781
00:33:55,451 --> 00:33:56,891
As two people wrapped in bandages,

782
00:33:57,011 --> 00:33:58,651
we couldn't even stay still in the ward.

783
00:33:59,411 --> 00:34:01,011
but ran to the factory at midnight.

784
00:34:01,770 --> 00:34:03,370
You looked at the stars and night view,

785
00:34:04,251 --> 00:34:04,891
while I

786
00:34:05,731 --> 00:34:06,971
only had eyes for you.

787
00:34:07,731 --> 00:34:09,491
I want to cherish and commemorate

788
00:34:09,650 --> 00:34:10,690
our first meeting forever.

789
00:34:17,851 --> 00:34:19,610
I saw you failed at making this earlier

790
00:34:19,891 --> 00:34:20,730
and seemed a bit sad.

791
00:34:21,130 --> 00:34:21,690
Now

792
00:34:22,050 --> 00:34:22,971
taste my cooking.

793
00:34:23,090 --> 00:34:23,931
I won't have any.

794
00:34:24,491 --> 00:34:25,596
I'm cutting back on sugar.

795
00:34:25,851 --> 00:34:26,491
Don't worry.

796
00:34:27,130 --> 00:34:28,299
I used a sugar substitute.

797
00:34:28,491 --> 00:34:29,451
You won't gain weight.

798
00:34:38,331 --> 00:34:38,851
Try some.

799
00:34:45,530 --> 00:34:45,971
How is it?

800
00:34:48,291 --> 00:34:48,971
Not good.

801
00:34:52,130 --> 00:34:53,610
That's strange.

802
00:34:56,050 --> 00:34:57,851
Which step did I mess up?

803
00:35:01,411 --> 00:35:02,371
Do you know

804
00:35:02,411 --> 00:35:03,931
where I went wrong

805
00:35:04,250 --> 00:35:05,291
when I made this dessert?

806
00:35:06,050 --> 00:35:06,690
Where?

807
00:35:08,050 --> 00:35:09,891
When I mixed the whipped egg whites

808
00:35:09,931 --> 00:35:11,170
with the yolks,

809
00:35:11,690 --> 00:35:12,610
I accidentally

810
00:35:13,130 --> 00:35:14,371
let in a third wheel.

811
00:35:17,291 --> 00:35:18,090
Water.

812
00:35:19,971 --> 00:35:21,610
I knocked over the cup without noticing

813
00:35:22,250 --> 00:35:23,291
and spilled some in.

814
00:35:26,491 --> 00:35:27,011
Honey,

815
00:35:27,730 --> 00:35:29,291
that's a humorous choice of words.

816
00:35:30,730 --> 00:35:32,610
Even pure water added in

817
00:35:33,130 --> 00:35:33,811
can ruin

818
00:35:33,851 --> 00:35:35,210
a simple dessert,

819
00:35:36,011 --> 00:35:37,210
let alone

820
00:35:37,811 --> 00:35:39,210
a complex relationship.

821
00:35:41,931 --> 00:35:42,771
You're right, honey.

822
00:35:43,530 --> 00:35:44,050
Honey,

823
00:35:45,931 --> 00:35:46,891
tell me.

824
00:35:47,931 --> 00:35:49,811
If a relationship is tainted

825
00:35:50,451 --> 00:35:51,811
by a third wheel,

826
00:35:52,730 --> 00:35:53,610
what should we do?

827
00:35:54,451 --> 00:35:55,291
In a relationship,

828
00:35:55,730 --> 00:35:56,971
there can't be a third wheel.

829
00:35:57,851 --> 00:35:58,411
But there are

830
00:35:59,331 --> 00:35:59,971
exceptions.

831
00:36:07,011 --> 00:36:07,491
Look.

832
00:36:10,491 --> 00:36:11,610
Guo Jun from Design

833
00:36:11,971 --> 00:36:13,371
shows off his son every day.

834
00:36:13,730 --> 00:36:15,570
He took annual leave these days

835
00:36:15,891 --> 00:36:16,891
and took his wife and kid

836
00:36:16,931 --> 00:36:17,610
to Sanya.

837
00:36:18,291 --> 00:36:18,811
His son

838
00:36:19,170 --> 00:36:20,250
is so attached to his mom.

839
00:36:20,771 --> 00:36:22,291
He won't let Guo Jun hold her hand.

840
00:36:22,891 --> 00:36:24,291
When I called him today, I joked,

841
00:36:24,650 --> 00:36:25,411
"You gave birth

842
00:36:25,451 --> 00:36:26,130
to a little

843
00:36:26,170 --> 00:36:27,210
third wheel."

844
00:36:29,210 --> 00:36:30,170
I was thinking,

845
00:36:30,210 --> 00:36:30,971
in the future,

846
00:36:31,050 --> 00:36:32,291
if we have a son,

847
00:36:32,931 --> 00:36:34,130
he'll be attached to you too.

848
00:36:34,570 --> 00:36:35,971
Sons take after their fathers.

849
00:36:36,891 --> 00:36:38,291
But I think you prefer daughters.

850
00:36:39,730 --> 00:36:40,451
Then

851
00:36:40,971 --> 00:36:42,011
we should make a wish

852
00:36:42,130 --> 00:36:43,130
to have a daughter.

853
00:36:46,690 --> 00:36:47,331
Give it to me.

854
00:36:48,331 --> 00:36:49,170
Did it spill on you?

855
00:36:49,210 --> 00:36:49,690
No.

856
00:36:50,371 --> 00:36:50,771
It's fine.

857
00:36:51,451 --> 00:36:52,250
I'll go change.

858
00:37:02,491 --> 00:37:03,050
Honey,

859
00:37:03,570 --> 00:37:05,050
what should I wear to work tomorrow?

860
00:37:28,291 --> 00:37:30,250
Don't touch me. I'm really tired.

861
00:37:30,451 --> 00:37:31,210
I'll sleep here.

862
00:37:31,530 --> 00:37:32,291
No,

863
00:37:32,811 --> 00:37:33,851
you'll catch a cold here.

864
00:37:34,170 --> 00:37:34,491
Come on.

865
00:37:37,771 --> 00:37:38,891
Don't touch me.

866
00:38:08,811 --> 00:38:09,638
What are you doing?

867
00:38:11,331 --> 00:38:12,530
You toss and turn at night.

868
00:38:12,891 --> 00:38:13,998
I worry you'll fall off.

869
00:38:14,210 --> 00:38:15,650
If I sleep here, I won't worry.

870
00:38:17,090 --> 00:38:17,931
Even if you fall,

871
00:38:18,491 --> 00:38:19,491
you'll fall into my arms.

872
00:38:22,411 --> 00:38:23,130
The floor is cold,

873
00:38:23,570 --> 00:38:24,730
and I won't fall off.

874
00:38:25,291 --> 00:38:26,371
Go back to the bedroom.

875
00:38:26,771 --> 00:38:27,331
Sleep now.

876
00:38:43,690 --> 00:38:45,610
(The moment he slept beside my couch,)

877
00:38:46,730 --> 00:38:47,690
(I finally realized)

878
00:38:49,011 --> 00:38:49,851
(that love)

879
00:38:51,411 --> 00:38:52,891
(can truly be faked.)

880
00:39:03,811 --> 00:39:04,411
What's wrong?

881
00:39:04,451 --> 00:39:05,331
You look so pale.

882
00:39:06,291 --> 00:39:07,011
Couldn't sleep?

883
00:39:07,971 --> 00:39:08,690
A little.

884
